<section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">Content Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">Last updated: <%= currentYear %></p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <%= siteTitle %> is an educational and utility resource. We provide video download guides and tools to help users access content they already have permission to use. This Content Policy explains what is and is not allowed.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">1. Permitted Use</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>Downloading videos you created, uploaded, or own the rights to.</li>
        <li>Saving public domain or Creative Commons licensed content.</li>
        <li>Downloading content where the rights holder has explicitly allowed downloads.</li>
        <li>Personal offline viewing of content you are authorized to access.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">2. Prohibited Use</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>Downloading copyrighted movies, TV shows, music videos, or any content without permission.</li>
        <li>Circumventing DRM, region locks, age restrictions, or authentication systems.</li>
        <li>Redistributing downloaded content without authorization.</li>
        <li>Using the service to harass, abuse, or violate any law.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">3. Copyright and Fair Use</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Users are responsible for understanding and complying with copyright law in their jurisdiction. <%= siteTitle %> does not host, index, or distribute third-party content. We process only the URLs submitted by users.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">4. Reporting Violations</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">If you see content or site usage that violates this policy, please contact us through the <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Contact</a> page.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">5. Policy Enforcement</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">We reserve the right to block access to specific URLs, restrict features, or terminate access to users who repeatedly violate this policy.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
